<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran-linked drones struck the Khor Mor gas field in Iraqi Kurdistan, halting production and cutting about 2.8 GW of power, while Iraqi forces responded with airstrikes on three suspected militants and a tunnel in Kirkuk's Zghaitun Valley. Iraqi officials identified the launch site of the Khor Mor attack and accused militia groups, whose leaders are seeking Chinese and Russian air defenses. Baghdad reopened the Sheeb border crossing with Iran after a three-week closure and agreed to withdraw Turkish forces from the Zilkan base by the end of 2026. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxQRjlSd2FrSzRhU0tEbmROLW4tVVFKdVM2WnU5dzgwb1RJRkpTTUM4RV9ES3Q0cTZFSmFYaXZKalpUbVhZcDEyckNsWC1JV3E4QXlsVXBxSVM5RHlXZ1Z2Z21jMU1HMzg4Q1RxNm9sQ3JmWGsyUDBPQURDdVpxYzFscXJiOXNxSFl4MDZVTU0xQ3NGYTJoeUFGSWhKZTV1bjdGUWJlSTNueDRwbGdzMlZXZVpJUDA3c2Q5RVlndS1zU3JaeDJzd1BzeDNB?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMickFVX3lxTFBSaEdnQU0ySkVVV1h6XzRJMGxTcEoycGpzdHdWWHRvb3l3Zm45UmF2SHlGbXBHcldVaTBTYlRBTW5xSldaYU5HbTYxTGkyczRDQVQ3dzR1dzIyUkxZZ3pfMDY1eHplSGN5YzdjT0doMzlUZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Energy Intelligence&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE5CQ2FKZ0syaVJfRDVkZ3Z3SUtEVk0xZGdHTTBJeUZ6VFpBbHVjZGZVVUR6VXF4dW5rOVRfNTZtSkt3NHJfYzI2cHJmZjlsTVZTRFQwR2I0YnZBSmlv?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiREFVX3lxTE9lZ0NabUZRM3dCVkVienRmM0JYbXowX2Y1cGZMaGcxUnQzR3IzUUZBSm52RmtvdWMzc2N3eWhJWnZjOUw1?oc=5&quot;&gt;964media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNTGktV2s0RG1pREg0Ny1GUmp6d1ZhU3dpTzk3S